Q("An item with no valid rate on the price list:", ["Cannot be added to the cart", "Scans at zero — flagged but not blocked", "Uses the cost price", "Asks for a price"], 1, "The classic silent leak.", "Ch3"),
Q("Two profiles with opposite tax treatments must not share a template because:", ["Templates are per branch", "Switching Is Tax Inclusive rewrites the template itself — each save would undo the other's behaviour", "Tax law forbids it", "Reports would merge"], 1, "One template per tax treatment.", "Ch3"),
